'''Fabrício Calazans''' ({{IPA|mxi|faˈβɾisi̯o kaˈlazans|lang}}; born 25 May 1985) is a [[Balisca|Baliscan]] politician and activist. He has served as the [[Deputy Secretary General of Balisca]] since 3 March 2025, and has been a delegate representing the [[Capitoline Hill (commune district)|Capitoline Hill]] [[commune district]] since 2015. 

